[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0010","text":"（嗯……天气真好）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0020","text":"（──不过，风挺大的呢……\n　……嗯？　那是────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0030","text":"果然是雾子\n但是──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0040","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0050","text":"（在哭……\n　是不是不要打扰她比较好……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0060","text":"制作人……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0070","text":"！\n哦、哦……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0080","text":"您好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0090","text":"……？　雾子，你没事……吗？\n那个，刚才……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_20801200_01_0100","text":"……？\n诶，那个……"}]
